    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d72">

                <pb facs="0223" n="57" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg57"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.00/2581</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Reinsch </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-06-08T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 8, 1917, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Chinese Minister here calls attention to the possibility of misunderstanding
                    a sentence in my June 4, 3 p.m., beginning with the words “with the form of
                    government.”</p>
                <pb facs="0224" n="58" xml:id="pg58"/>
                <p>If attention should be drawn to it or attempt be made to use it unfairly you are
                    authorized in your discretion to say in substance that the Department did not
                    have in mind the difference between a republic and a monarchy but referred to
                    the present strife in China over the organization and relation of various
                    branches of government. The American Government is not indifferent to the
                    maintenance of republican government in China. On the contrary it hopes for its
                    uninterrupted continuance.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
